WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:04.940
Some feelings arrive before the words do.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.050
Serenio listens for the shape beneath them.

3
00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:12.280
It reflects back what you're really feeling,

4
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.520
notices the patterns you can't quite see,

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.230
and remembers how your day actually felt.

6
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:21.890
Serenio.

7
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.140
A quieter place for what you feel.
